# 9- to 16-byte values (structs of two ints, str, slices, ?int, an error union) across direct calls,
# a fn table and a become: on x86_64-windows the direct calls pass them in register pairs and the
# others by reference. Both profiles; Windows only, the one target whose lowering differs (the
# others pass these values in registers under their C ABI).
case ok
target x86_64-windows
stdout internalabi.out
